{"name": "Reclaim: Earth Protocol", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reclaim Earth from an alien invasion in a unique blend of auto battler, and roguelite strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your squad, create powerful synergies, deploy support drones, and adapt your strategy to survive relentless alien waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Resistance</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit and command units with unique battlefield roles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frontline defenders hold the line while ranged units and specialists shape the fight. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/b2afefdc769e3733417a1752b16f1a00.poster.avif?t=1780471163\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/b2afefdc769e3733417a1752b16f1a00.webm?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/b2afefdc769e3733417a1752b16f1a00.mp4?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your positioning and composition determine every outcome.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/43d7407a8ff925a630d76813329c3bd6.poster.avif?t=1780471163\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/43d7407a8ff925a630d76813329c3bd6.webm?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/43d7407a8ff925a630d76813329c3bd6.mp4?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Devastating Synergies</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory is not about a single unit \u2014 it's about how your squad works together. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine abilities and roles to trigger powerful synergies that can wipe out entire enemy waves. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/a683fab27a2efb21f39b2dd16b2af8a6.poster.avif?t=1780471163\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/a683fab27a2efb21f39b2dd16b2af8a6.webm?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/a683fab27a2efb21f39b2dd16b2af8a6.mp4?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade and Evolve Your Squad</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new abilities, enhance performance, and shape your build as the battlefield grows more dangerous. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every upgrade pushes your strategy in a new direction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/7dfbcfc008d2641e7533973cedec8237.poster.avif?t=1780471163\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/7dfbcfc008d2641e7533973cedec8237.webm?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/7dfbcfc008d2641e7533973cedec8237.mp4?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deploy Drones and Elite Abilities</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Call in powerful drone support and unleash elite abilities at critical moments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn the tide of battle with precise timing and tactical decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/fa6f8bf57df2912176da2b14f6b6d8f2.poster.avif?t=1780471163\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/fa6f8bf57df2912176da2b14f6b6d8f2.webm?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/fa6f8bf57df2912176da2b14f6b6d8f2.mp4?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight Alien Armies and Massive Bosses</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face swarming enemy forces and towering alien bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your squad and refine your strategy to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/58fc7f480f95a332cf6d74959ec11465.poster.avif?t=1780471163\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/58fc7f480f95a332cf6d74959ec11465.webm?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/extras/58fc7f480f95a332cf6d74959ec11465.mp4?t=1780471163\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity has fallen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The counterattack begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Wishlist now and be ready to reclaim Earth.</strong></i></u></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A squad-based auto-battler where your strategy drives a living battlefield. Deploy units, trigger devastating combos, and reclaim Earth from an alien invasion.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540900/008ec9af815e8c24c24f8aeda064d99b7abdef30/header.jpg?t=1780471163", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Strategy", "Roguelite", "Real Time Tactics", "Pixel Graphics", "Resource Management"], "developers": "Lazy Avocado Studio", "publishers": "Lazy Avocado Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4540900", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Phsw5LLf3TU", "first_seen": 1780005600.0, "review_rank": 554}